  "prompt": "A surreal valley under a dim, misty sky, filled with ghostlike structures that resemble homes, trees, and glowing paths all made of semi-transparent fog. The landscape feels deceptively welcoming from afar, but upon approach, everything is hollow and intangible. Faceless humanoid figures wander aimlessly, dissolving into air when touched. An eerie house made of mist stands still; inside are many shattered mirrors, each broken at the center, reflecting only fragments of the viewer. A lone traveler stands among it all, quietly observing. The atmosphere is dreamlike, melancholic, and symbolic evoking the fear of abandonment, not from loss, but from what never truly arrived. The palette is soft grays, faded blues, and pale whites. --ar 9:16 --raw --v 7",
